# Exclusions for Plugin Check, applied with --use-pcpignore (CLI) or
# "Use .pcpignore custom exclusions" (admin page). Paths are anchored to the
# plugin root; a trailing slash marks a directory.
#
# Mirrors .distignore, so a scan of the repository sees exactly what ships.

